ei Wuxian's fall from grace continues as more light is shed on his descent into the path of demonic cultivation. The demonic arm only further strains his mischievous spirit. This is the time for him to prove that he has truly broken free from the forbidden path and is not the maniacal sorcerer that everyone remembers him to be."],"ja":["魔道祖师 第二季",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-49605":"2023-06-09T17:54:00Z","serial-19800":"2022-08-07T17:23:38Z","serial-31743":"2021-01-13T14:31:22Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-49605","serial-19800","serial-31743"],"relatedMalIds":[37208,40434],"availableEpisodeCount":8,"rating":8.45,"relations":[{"id":37208,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":40434,"relation":"sequel"}]}]}